      "rect" : [
        380.9873,
        19.871300000000002,
        195.28949999999998,
        13.27
      ],
      "text" : "Dietary Guidelines for Americans, 2025–2030 | 1"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        54,
        654.91070000000002,
        382.33600000000001,
        13.269999999999982
      ],
      "structure" : {
        "group" : 3,
        "headingLevel" : 0,
        "lineCount" : 1,
        "opensWithSplitMarker" : false,
        "order" : 7
      },
      "text" : "These Guidelines mark the most significant reset of federal nutrition policy in our nation’s history."
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        54,
        636.41070000000002,
        150.32000000000002,
        13.269999999999982
      ],
      "structure" : {
        "group" : 4,
        "headingLevel" : 0,
        "lineCount" : 1,
        "opensWithSplitMarker" : false,
        "order" : 8
      },
      "text" : "The message is simple: eat real food."
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10.5,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        54,
        617.77520000000004,
        496.2478500000002,
        13.933499999999981
      ],
      "structure" : {
        "group" : 5,
        "headingLevel" : 0,
        "lineCount" : 4,
        "opensWithSplitMarker" : false,
        "order" : 9
      },
      "text" : "To Make America Healthy Again, we must return to the basics. American households must prioritize diets built on whole,"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10.5,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        54,
        603.77520000000004,
        277.39320000000004,
        13.933499999999981
      ],
      "structure" : {
        "group" : 5,
        "headingLevel" : 0,
        "lineCount" : 4,
        "opensWithSplitMarker" : false,
        "order" : 10
      },
      "text" : "nutrient-dense foods—protein, dairy, vegetables, fruits, healthy fats,"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10.5,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        54,
        589.77520000000004,
        517.53240000000028,
        13.933499999999981
      ],
      "structure" : {
        "group" : 5,
        "headingLevel" : 0,
        "lineCount" : 4,
        "opensWithSplitMarker" : false,
        "order" : 12
      },
      "text" : "and whole grains. Paired with a dramatic reduction in highly processed foods laden with refined carbohydrates, added sugars,"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10.5,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        54,
        575.77520000000004,
        521.2084500000002,
        13.933499999999981
      ],
      "structure" : {
        "group" : 5,
        "headingLevel" : 0,
        "lineCount" : 4,
        "opensWithSplitMarker" : false,
        "order" : 13
      },
      "text" : "excess sodium, unhealthy fats, and chemical additives, this approach can change the health trajectory for so many Americans."
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10.5,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        54,
        557.27520000000004,
        457.02300000000002,
        13.933499999999981
      ],
      "structure" : {
        "group" : 6,
        "headingLevel" : 0,
        "lineCount" : 4,
        "opensWithSplitMarker" : false,
        "order" : 14
      },
      "text" : "The United States is amid a health emergency. Nearly 90% of health care spending goes to treating people who"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10.5,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        54,
        543.27520000000004,
        448.03409999999985,
        13.933499999999981
      ],
      "structure" : {
        "group" : 6,
        "headingLevel" : 0,
        "lineCount" : 4,
        "opensWithSplitMarker" : false,
        "order" : 16
      },
      "text" : "have chronic diseases.1 Many of these illnesses are not genetic destiny; they are the predictable result of the"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10.5,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        54,
        529.27520000000004,
        515.66550000000029,
        13.933499999999981
      ],
      "structure" : {
        "group" : 6,
        "headingLevel" : 0,
        "lineCount" : 4,
        "opensWithSplitMarker" : false,
        "order" : 20
      },
      "text" : "Standard American Diet—a diet which, over time, has become reliant on highly processed foods and coupled with a sedentary"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10.5,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        54,
        515.27520000000004,
        35.384999999999991,
        13.933499999999981
      ],
      "structure" : {
        "group" : 6,
        "headingLevel" : 0,
        "lineCount" : 4,
        "opensWithSplitMarker" : false,
        "order" : 21
      },
      "text" : "lifestyle."
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10.5,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        54,
        496.77519999999998,
        507.39930000000004,
        13.933499999999981
      ],
      "structure" : {
        "group" : 7,
        "headingLevel" : 0,
        "lineCount" : 4,
        "opensWithSplitMarker" : false,
        "order" : 22
      },
      "text" : "The consequences have been devastating. More than 70% of American adults are overweight or obese.2 Nearly one in three"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10.5,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        54,
        482.77519999999998,
        502.6022999999999,
        13.933499999999981
      ],
      "structure" : {
        "group" : 7,
        "headingLevel" : 0,
        "lineCount" : 4,
        "opensWithSplitMarker" : false,
        "order" : 25
      },
      "text" : "American adolescents between the ages of 12 and 17 has prediabetes.3 Diet-driven chronic disease now disqualifies large"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10.5,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        54,
        468.77519999999998,
        494.63400000000001,
        13.933499999999981
      ],
      "structure" : {
        "group" : 7,
        "headingLevel" : 0,
        "lineCount" : 4,
        "opensWithSplitMarker" : false,
        "order" : 28
      },
      "text" : "numbers of young Americans from military service, undermining national readiness and cutting off a historic pathway to"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10.5,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        54,
        454.77519999999998,
        139.35482100000002,
        13.933499999999981
      ],
      "structure" : {
        "group" : 7,
        "headingLevel" : 0,
        "lineCount" : 4,
        "opensWithSplitMarker" : false,
        "order" : 29
      },
      "text" : "opportunity and upward mobility.4"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10.5,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        54,
        436.27519999999998,
        509.0001000000002,
        13.933499999999981
      ],
      "structure" : {
        "group" : 8,
        "headingLevel" : 0,
        "lineCount" : 3,
        "opensWithSplitMarker" : false,
        "order" : 32
      },
      "text" : "For decades, federal incentives have promoted low-quality, highly processed foods and pharmaceutical intervention instead"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10.5,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        54,
        422.27519999999998,
        515.22765000000038,
        13.933499999999981
      ],
      "structure" : {
        "group" : 8,
        "headingLevel" : 0,
        "lineCount" : 3,
        "opensWithSplitMarker" : false,
        "order" : 33
      },
      "text" : "of prevention. This crisis is the result of poor policy choices; inadequate nutrition research; and a lack of coordination across"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10.5,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        54,
        408.27519999999998,
        168.93764999999999,
        13.933499999999981
      ],
      "structure" : {
        "group" : 8,
        "headingLevel" : 0,
        "lineCount" : 3,
        "opensWithSplitMarker" : false,
        "order" : 34
      },
      "text" : "federal, state, local, and private partners."
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10.5,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        54,
        389.77519999999998,
        84.495600000000024,
        13.933499999999981
      ],
      "structure" : {
        "group" : 9,
        "headingLevel" : 0,
        "lineCount" : 1,
        "opensWithSplitMarker" : false,
        "order" : 35
      },
      "text" : "This changes today."
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10.5,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        54,
        371.27519999999998,
        513.67155000000014,
        13.933499999999981
      ],
      "structure" : {
        "group" : 10,
        "headingLevel" : 0,
        "lineCount" : 2,
        "opensWithSplitMarker" : false,
        "order" : 36
      },
      "text" : "We are realigning our food system to support American farmers, ranchers, and companies who grow and produce real food—"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10.5,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        54,
        357.27519999999998,
        310.93649999999968,
        13.933499999999981
      ],
      "structure" : {
        "group" : 10,
        "headingLevel" : 0,
        "lineCount" : 2,
        "opensWithSplitMarker" : false,
        "order" : 37
      },
      "text" : "and the Trump administration is working to ensure all families can afford it."
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10.5,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        54,
        338.77519999999998,
        515.60564999999963,
        13.933499999999981
      ],
      "structure" : {
        "group" : 11,
        "headingLevel" : 0,
        "lineCount" : 2,
        "opensWithSplitMarker" : false,
        "order" : 38
      },
      "text" : "We are putting real food back at the center of the American diet. Real food that nourishes the body. Real food that restores"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10.5,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        54,
        324.77519999999998,
        449.20889999999997,
        13.933499999999981
      ],
      "structure" : {
        "group" : 11,
        "headingLevel" : 0,
        "lineCount" : 2,
        "opensWithSplitMarker" : false,
        "order" : 39
      },
      "text" : "health. Real food that fuels energy and encourages movement and exercise. Real food that builds strength."
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10.5,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        54,
        306.27519999999998,
        505.0930500000004,
        13.933499999999981
      ],
      "structure" : {
        "group" : 12,
        "headingLevel" : 0,
        "lineCount" : 3,
        "opensWithSplitMarker" : false,
        "order" : 40
      },
      "text" : "Under President Trump’s leadership, we are restoring common sense, scientific integrity, and accountability to federal food"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10.5,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        54,
        292.27519999999998,
        514.00755000000004,
        13.933499999999981
      ],
      "structure" : {
        "group" : 12,
        "headingLevel" : 0,
        "lineCount" : 3,
        "opensWithSplitMarker" : false,
        "order" : 41
      },
      "text" : "and health policy—and we are reclaiming the food pyramid and returning it to its true purpose of educating and nourishing all"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10.5,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        54,
        278.27519999999998,
        46.966500000000011,
        13.933499999999981
      ],
      "structure" : {
        "group" : 12,
        "headingLevel" : 0,
        "lineCount" : 3,
        "opensWithSplitMarker" : false,
        "order" : 42
      },
      "text" : "Americans."
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10.5,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        54,
        259.77519999999998,
        497.1151500000002,
        13.933499999999981
      ],
      "structure" : {
        "group" : 13,
        "headingLevel" : 0,
        "lineCount" : 3,
        "opensWithSplitMarker" : false,
        "order" : 43
      },
      "text" : "These Guidelines call on every American to eat more real food. They call on farmers, ranchers, health care professionals,"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10.5,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        54,
        245.77520000000001,
        454.21005000000008,
        13.933500000000009
      ],
      "structure" : {
        "group" : 13,
        "headingLevel" : 0,
        "lineCount" : 3,
        "opensWithSplitMarker" : false,
        "order" : 44
      },
      "text" : "insurers, educators, community leaders, industry, and lawmakers across all levels of government to join in this"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10.5,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        54,
        231.77520000000001,
        56.785049999999984,
        13.933500000000009
      ],
      "structure" : {
        "group" : 13,
        "headingLevel" : 0,
        "lineCount" : 3,
        "opensWithSplitMarker" : false,
        "order" : 46
      },
      "text" : "critical effort."
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10.5,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        54,
        213.27520000000001,
        491.43255000000022,
        13.933500000000009
      ],
      "structure" : {
        "group" : 14,
        "headingLevel" : 0,
        "lineCount" : 2,
        "opensWithSplitMarker" : false,
        "order" : 47
      },
      "text" : "Together, we can shift our food system away from chronic disease and toward nutrient density, nourishment, resilience,"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10.5,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        54,
        199.27520000000001,
        88.115999999999985,
        13.933500000000009
      ],
      "structure" : {
        "group" : 14,
        "headingLevel" : 0,
        "lineCount" : 2,
        "opensWithSplitMarker" : false,
        "order" : 49
      },
      "text" : "and long-term health."
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10.5,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        54,
        178.77520000000001,
        353.39219999999989,
        13.933500000000009
      ],
      "structure" : {
        "group" : 15,
        "headingLevel" : 0,
        "lineCount" : 1,
        "opensWithSplitMarker" : false,
        "order" : 50
      },
      "text" : "America’s future depends on what we grow, what we serve, and what we choose to eat."
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10.5,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
